# ==============================================================================
# MÓDULO: AUTENTICACIÓN
# Requiere: REST Client (extensión VS Code)
# Base URL: http://localhost:8017
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8017

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-01: Login con credenciales válidas
# RF: Autenticación de usuarios
# Resultado esperado: 200 OK con accessToken y refreshToken
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login Superadmin (caso feliz)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@warengine.local",
  "password": "Warengine.Admin.2026!"
}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-02: Verificar sesión activa con token válido
# RF: Validación de tokens JWT
# Resultado esperado: 200 OK con mensaje de sesión activa
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Verificar sesión activa
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verificar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-03: Renovar access token usando refresh token
# RF: Renovación de tokens
# Resultado esperado: 200 OK con nuevo accessToken
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Renovar token con refreshToken del login anterior
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/renovar-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-04: Cerrar sesión
# RF: Cierre de sesión
# Resultado esperado: 200 OK, cookies HttpOnly limpiadas
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Logout (cierra sesión)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-05: Health Check del servidor
# Resultado esperado: 200 OK con texto "Warengine API - OK"
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

# ==============================================================================
# CASOS DE ERROR ESPERADOS
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-ERR-01: Login con contraseña incorrecta → 401
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login fallido - contraseña incorrecta
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@warengine.local",
  "password": "ContrasenaIncorrecta!"
}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-ERR-02: Login con email inexistente → 401
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login fallido - email no registrado
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@warengine.local",
  "password": "Warengine.Admin.2026!"
}

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-ERR-03: Acceder a ruta protegida sin token → 401
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ruta protegida sin token (debe devolver 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verificar

###

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UC-AUTH-ERR-04: Validación de esquema - email inválido → 400
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login con email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "Warengine.Admin.2026!"
}

###
